irmed it to Dana in a thread reply on her #north-team message. Nothing else was needed.\n\nThe brain only had Dana's own message about this date, so there was nothing to check it against. An older public note says Brackenwater moved to Marcus Lindqvist in September 2025, but I didn't treat that as a reason to question Dana's update.\n```","id":4,"source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"marcus-lindqvist"}
